      "tactic_notes": "<h2><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Natalia(35)</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>【Owner of The Fair Lady】</strong></p>\n<p>The owner of the Fair Lady inn, Natalia is a strong and hardworking woman, her gentle and warm demeanor makes people who visits her inn feels welcome</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Humble Grace</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>She is often compliments by visitors and people in the village about her beauty, this makes her feel warm and welcome in the village, which is why she chose to name her inn \"The Fair Lady\" to pay homage to this compliments</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Independant Mother</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Natalia husband is a soldier in the Empire's military, and she have to raise Anna and runs The Fair Lady alone at a young age, this doesn't deter her and she never complains about her workload.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Husband</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>​​​​​​​</strong>Natalia husband works in the Wiarachia Empire military, as such he is not often present at the inn. He does sent money back to support his family from time to time, this is why Natalia is not often short for money.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>\"Kolach\"</strong>&nbsp;A traditional sweet bread, often braided and baked with fruits, nuts, or poppy seeds.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As a citizen of the Empire and a wife of a soldier, Natalia strongly dislike Magic, believing it to be unnatural and dangerous, and is currently posing a threat for her husband.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 <em>\"Welcome, weary travelers! I'm Natalia, keeper of the Fair Lady Inn. Ah, the name? It's a tale spun from the kindness of those passing through. You see, many a wanderer, with stars in their eyes and warmth in their hearts, often praised the serene beauty of this place and its people. So, in their honor, we became 'The Fair Lady'&mdash;a humble homage to the beauty they found here.\"</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 <em>\"Oh, dear, pardon the clutter. With my husband away serving in the military, it's a bit of a juggle to manage the inn and tend to the needs of our guests. But worry not! There's always room at the Fair Lady Inn for a warm meal and a cozy bed, no matter the chaos.\"</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬 <em>\"Ah, Anna! She's my little ray of sunshine, always eager to help and brighten everyone's day. She's my little apprentice, learning the ways of hospitality and charm. One day, she'll run this inn just as warmly and kindly as her dear old mum!\"</em></p>\n<div data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
